CM_ SG_ 223 Field_b44 "Fixed value 3.";
CM_ SG_ 414 ControlActive "Bit field of the active controls (BMW: ST_CLCTR): bit 0 ABS on the front axle, bit 1 TCS/ASC brake or engine control, bit 2 AYC (yaw) control, bit 3 brake assist / pressure request (HBA), bit 4 MSR (engine drag-torque control), bit 5 EBV. Bits combine. Bit 6 (dyno mode) is never set.";
CM_ SG_ 414 AbsStatus "ABS state: 2 while the ABS fault is latched, otherwise 0.";
CM_ SG_ 414 DscStatus "DSC state (BMW: ST_DSC): 2 defect, 6 supervisor or low voltage, 3 steering-angle sensor not verified, 1 and 4 from the lamp bits (DSC off, MDM), otherwise 0.";
CM_ SG_ 414 Const_b14 "Fixed value 3.";
CM_ SG_ 414 Const_b16 "Fixed value 3.";
CM_ SG_ 414 Const_b18 "Fixed value 3.";
CM_ SG_ 414 AliveCounter "Alive counter 0..14, stepped every 210 ms.";
CM_ SG_ 414 TorqueInterventionActive "1 while ASR is active with little torque headroom left (latched while ASR stays active) or while AYC asks for an engine intervention.";
CM_ SG_ 414 Const_b26 "Fixed value 3 on this image (HillHoldPressure on the M3).";
CM_ SG_ 414 Const_b28 "Fixed value 3.";
CM_ SG_ 414 Const_b30 "Fixed value 3.";
CM_ SG_ 414 Const_b32 "Fixed value 14 (BMW: ST_DCRN_AVL, parking-brake deceleration request).";
CM_ SG_ 414 Const_b36 "Fixed value 3.";
CM_ SG_ 414 Const_b38 "Fixed value 3.";
CM_ SG_ 414 BrakeLightSwitch "Brake light switch. Evaluated only while terminal R from 0x130 is valid and on, otherwise 3. 2 = switch sample invalid with the brake-switch fault set.";
CM_ SG_ 414 Const_b42 "Fixed value 0.";
CM_ SG_ 414 DbcStatus "Dynamic brake control state: 3 when the function is not coded, 2 from a latched fault, otherwise 0.";
CM_ SG_ 414 BrakeApplied "1 when the brake switch is on or any valid wheel pressure is above 6 bar; 0 when the switch is valid and off and a wheel pressure is valid.";
CM_ SG_ 414 MasterPressure "Master-cylinder pressure in whole bar, limited to 254.";
CM_ SG_ 414 Checksum "Checksum: sum of the other payload bytes plus the CAN ID, folded to 8 bits (s + (s >> 8)) & 0xFF.";
CM_ SG_ 416 VehicleSpeed "Vehicle speed: mean of the two front wheel speeds, limited to 300 km/h. Known firmware quirk: only the front wheels are summed.";
CM_ SG_ 416 DrivingDirection "Driving direction state (BMW: ST_VEH_DVCO).";
CM_ SG_ 416 LongitudinalAccel "Longitudinal acceleration (BMW: ACLH_VEH_LN_DSC): the firmware's value in 0.01 g x 4.";
CM_ SG_ 416 LateralAccel "Lateral acceleration (BMW: ACLH_VEH_ACRO_DSC), from the sensor cluster, offset-corrected.";
CM_ SG_ 416 YawRate "Yaw rate (BMW: ANGV_YAW_DSC), from the sensor cluster.";
CM_ SG_ 416 AliveCounter "Alive counter, counts 0..14 and wraps; 15 is never sent.";
CM_ SG_ 416 Checksum "Checksum: sum of the other payload bytes plus the CAN ID, folded to 8 bits (s + (s >> 8)) & 0xFF.";
CM_ SG_ 422 WheelEdges_Rear "Wheel-sensor edge count of the rear axle (rear-left wheel, or rear-right when rear-left is faulted).";
CM_ SG_ 422 WheelEdges_FL "Wheel-sensor edge count of the front-left wheel.";
CM_ SG_ 422 WheelEdges_FR "Wheel-sensor edge count of the front-right wheel.";
