CM_ SG_ 690 WheelPressure_FR "Front-right wheel brake pressure in whole bar (0.01 bar / 100), limited to 254.";
CM_ SG_ 690 WheelPressure_RL "Rear-left wheel brake pressure in whole bar (0.01 bar / 100), limited to 254.";
CM_ SG_ 690 WheelPressure_RR "Rear-right wheel brake pressure in whole bar (0.01 bar / 100), limited to 254.";
